{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Getuigen Verhalen, Getuigen van de geschiedenis van Anne Frank, interview 18"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:41665"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Anne Frank Stichting ©"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"L van Heesch"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Anne Frank Stichting"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Otto Frank kende de geinterviewde en haar man al voor de oorlog. Na de oorlog heeft Otto Frank geinterviewde, man en gezin echt goed leren kennen. Hun naam staat vaak in zijn agenda evenals de verjaardagen van hun drie zonen.<br><br>In 1951 vertrekt de familie naar de Verenigde Staten. Er bleef briefcontact bestaan. Otto bracht Albert Hackett en diens vrouw met hen in contact toen deze bezig waren met het toneelstuk.<\/p><p>Otto correspondeert ook met de zoons van geinterviewde tot aan zijn overlijden in 1980.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2010-03-30"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typ